node_modules
dist
data
# Every dotfile/dotdir at the build-context root (VCS metadata, editor config, run-pipeline data
# directories, etc.) - none of them are named in the Dockerfile's COPY statements, so excluding the
# whole class is both more robust to future additions and avoids naming any one of them individually.
.*
sample_actor_ts/node_modules
sample_actor_ts/dist
sample_actor_py/__pycache__
test
*.md
